k in time just a few  minutes at the docks of gotham harbour a  mysterious figure leaves the water it's  the foundation we last saw him fall  through the zero point months ago his  first word in dc comic book history is  the greatest you'll ever hear he says  yep that's his first line ever  we get a great piece of law on the next  few panels which explain how all this  happened during the zero point crisis  the foundation sealed himself into the  zero point to protect reality from  destruction he was essentially like a  medic giving the zero point the time it  needed to heal itself after all the  times agent johnsy overused that orb it  needed a break but before it was  completely fixed an alien mothership of  the last reality attached to the spire  it's still unclear if this was a  destruction attempt or an endeavor to  steal the zero point away what we do  know is that the foundation fell through  the zero point exiting the time stream  at the last place on record which was  gotham city arising from the harbour  water foundation and batman meet  batman's on home turf and goes with the  tough guy routine  you're going to tell me who you are  how you got here  and what you think you're doing in my  city  very intimidating betsy yet foundation  isn't bothered in the slightest and  flies away i'm the rock i mean i'm the  foundation he says and i have no time  for you or your filthy city batman takes  this personally and connects the  foundation's foot to the batmobile  bringing him back down to earth the  fight goes on for pages and pages with  no man getting the overall upper edge  remember the fight with agent jones and  all of a sudden he stopped when he heard  the word geno  i can get you to geno  this time the code word is zero point  suddenly the foundation wants to be  allies with batman you know about the  zero point you've been there batman  admits to being there recently and tells  of an organization that manipulates the  island foundation says it how it is 