 his memories this  is a win-win situation for bruce wayne  but plot twist the foundation is totally  fine without realizing he was at the  center of the final storm circle and the  final survivor he now lives on the  island outside the loop and off he pops  to find io meanwhile in the next loop  the batman who laughs is having the time  of his life we see him murder a tomato  and everyone be honest right now who  thought this guy was wearing a tomato  mask  i certainly did well it turns out he  really had a tomato for a head  fortnite joker's visor sorry i mean the  batman who laughs visor is made from the  world forge which is the realm of dark  matter in the dc world the sheer energy  of that thing is strong enough to fight  off the loop's effects and keeps this  batman's memories all intact he wonders  about snapshots and if he could make a  conga line of the batman who laugh so i  did it for him good call finally we hear  the batman who laughs tell us why he's  really here i've devoted my life to  corrupting different universes i won't  be limited to one multiverse anymore and  that's how it ends to be continued the  batman who laughs doesn't want a  universe he doesn't want a multiverse  he's going for the full omniverse  corrupting every reality he comes in  contact with and that's where we're at  after this one-off comic book there's  lots more to delve into next time we'll  figure out what on earth the omniverse  is a quick thank you to those who use  code adamarros this week is dedicated to  the discord members thank you very much  i'm adam you're awesome i'll see you  again very soon

